WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.290
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: Search the Web Like a Pro.

2
00:00:05.590 --> 00:00:10.169
Find useful information quickly and safely. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:11.183 --> 00:00:14.521
Step one. Open your browser and click the search box.

4
00:00:15.517 --> 00:00:21.597
Step two. Type keywords, not a long sentence. For example, healthy food students.

5
00:00:22.583 --> 00:00:28.396
Step three. Press Enter. Read the title and the web address of each result before you click.

6
00:00:29.383 --> 00:00:37.031
Step four. Check the source. School, government and health websites are usually more reliable than unknown pages.

7
00:00:38.017 --> 00:00:41.807
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:42.107 --> 00:00:44.257
Search for healthy food students.

9
00:00:44.557 --> 00:00:48.438
Search with quotes: "healthy breakfast" for exact words.

10
00:00:48.738 --> 00:00:50.551
Find who wrote the page and when.

11
00:00:50.851 --> 00:00:51.934
Well done!

